WEBVTT

00:14:57.292 --> 00:15:00.643
as there is to all
systemic abuses of power.

00:15:00.667 --> 00:15:03.625
Structure is what makes them systemic.

00:15:05.083 --> 00:15:07.018
I'm asking people here

00:15:07.042 --> 00:15:09.101
to see the structure,

00:15:09.125 --> 00:15:11.518
where the power is in it,

00:15:11.542 --> 00:15:14.893
and even more importantly
to see the humanity

00:15:14.917 --> 00:15:18.375
of those of us made targets
by this structure.

00:15:19.042 --> 00:15:25.184
I am here because I was loved
and invested in and protected and lucky,

00:15:25.208 --> 00:15:28.351
because I went to the right schools,
I'm semifamous, mostly happy,

00:15:28.375 --> 00:15:30.143
meditate twice a day,